for every `ε > 0` the event `|X − E X| ≥ ε` has probability `0`.

*Hint:* Chebyshev bounds the probability by `0 / ε²`; probabilities are non-negative.

*Uses:* `FinProb.chebyshev`, `FinProb.prob_nonneg`. -/
